    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Honey Bunny Kidz presents: Lulu Lamb's Brush Your Teeth Song!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "bathroom",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "honey_pj",
     "x": 0.25
    },
    {
     "id": "lulu",
     "x": 0.48
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Good morning! Last night, Lulu Lamb had a sleepover at Honey's house."
    },
    {
     "who": "honey_pj",
     "text": "Good morning, Lulu!"
    },
    {
     "who": "lulu",
     "text": "Baa! Good morning, Honey. Let's go and play!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "bathroom",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "mama",
     "x": 0.2
    },
    {
     "id": "honey_pj",
     "x": 0.38
    },
    {
     "id": "lulu",
     "x": 0.56
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "mama",
     "text": "Good morning, little ones! Before we play, what do we do with a toothbrush?",
     "pause": 2.0
    },
    {
     "who": "honey_pj",
     "text": "We brush our teeth!"
    },
    {
     "who": "lulu",
     "text": "Oh! But Mama Bunny, I forgot my toothbrush at home."
    },
    {
     "who": "mama",
     "text": "That's okay, Lulu. I have a little surprise for you."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "bathroom",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "mama",
     "x": 0.2
    },
    {
     "id": "tb_lulu",
     "x": 0.29,
     "y": 0.72
    },
    {
     "id": "lulu",
     "x": 0.56
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "mama",
     "text": "Look! A brand new toothbrush. It is lavender, with a fluffy white cloud on it."
    },
    {
     "who": "mama",
     "text": "Lavender, like a bow. Fluffy, like soft wool. Whose toothbrush is it?",
     "pause": 2.0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "bathroom",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "mama",
     "x": 0.2
    },
    {
     "id": "tb_lulu",
     "x": 0.29,
     "y": 0.72,
     "glow": true
    },
    {
     "id": "lulu",
     "x": 0.56
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "mama",
     "text": "It's for you, Lulu! Your very own toothbrush, to keep at Honey's house."
    },
    {
     "who": "lulu",
     "text": "For me? Baa! Thank you, Mama Bunny! It matches my lavender bow!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "bathroom",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "honey_pj",
     "x": 0.3
    },
    {
     "id": "toothpaste",
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.7
    },
    {
     "id": "lulu",
     "x": 0.805,
     "y": 0.79
    },
    {
     "id": "tb_lulu_paste",
     "x": 0.88,
     "y": 0.74
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Lulu stood on the little pink step, so she could reach the sink."
    },
    {
     "who": "honey_pj",
     "text": "Now, the toothpaste. How much do we need? A big, big blob? Or just a tiny bit?",
     "pause": 2.0
    },
    {
     "who": "honey_pj",
     "text": "Just a tiny bit, as small as a pea. A grown-up helps!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "bathroom",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "honey_pj",
     "x": 0.3
    },
    {
     "id": "lulu_foam",
     "x": 0.805,
     "y": 0.79
    },
    {
     "id": "tb_lulu",
     "x": 0.88,
     "y": 0.74
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "lulu_foam",
     "text": "I am ready! Brush, brush, brush. Done!"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Lulu brushed so fast! Little bubbles went everywhere."
    },
    {
     "who": "honey_pj",
     "text": "Hee hee! Lulu, you have a bubble beard!"
    },
    {
     "who": "lulu_foam",
     "text": "Oops! Was that too fast?"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "bathroom",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "mama",
     "x": 0.2
    },
    {
     "id": "honey_pj",
     "x": 0.4
    },
    {
     "id": "lulu_foam",
     "x": 0.805,
     "y": 0.79
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "mama",
     "text": "A little too fast, Lulu. Teeth like slow, gentle brushing. Let's sing a song, and brush slowly."
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Everyone at home, hold up your finger like a toothbrush!",
     "pause": 2.0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "bathroom",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "mama",
     "x": 0.14
    },
    {
     "id": "honey_pj",
     "x": 0.32
    },
    {
     "id": "tb_honey",
     "x": 0.4,
     "y": 0.74
    },
    {
     "id": "lulu",
     "x": 0.805,
     "y": 0.79
    },
    {
     "id": "tb_lulu",
     "x": 0.88,
     "y": 0.74
    }
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Sing with us!",
     "pause": 0.8
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Brush, brush, round and round!",
     "pause": 0.5
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Top teeth, bottom teeth, all around!",
     "pause": 0.5
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Little circles, soft and slow.",
     "pause": 0.5
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Sparkly smile, and off we go!",
     "pause": 0.9
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "bg": "bathroom",
   "cast": [
    {
     "id": "honey_pj",
